<section begin=Intro />'''Fear''' is a [[disable]] that forces units to either flee away from or towards the source of the fear, or towards their own [[fountain]]. Affected units cannot be controlled.<section end=Intro />

== Definition ==

Fears cancel all of a unit's current orders, prevents any new orders being given or {{Key press|shiftqueue}} and temporarily restricts their movement, depending on the sub-type of fear that is being applied.

